Description:
    Adds Mixin Blaze message routing to this Rails application: a routes
    initializer wired to MixinBot's `blaze_handler`, an example text handler
    under app/mixin/handlers, and the `mixin_blaze` Puma plugin line in
    config/puma.rb so messages are received inside the web process tree.

    Requires MixinBot bot credentials (app_id, session_id,
    session_private_key, server_public_key) to be configured, e.g. from
    environment variables.

Example:
    rails generate mixin_bot:blaze

    This will create:
        config/initializers/mixin_bot_blaze.rb
        app/mixin/handlers/text_handler.rb

    It will also add `plugin :mixin_blaze` to config/puma.rb (creating it
    when missing) without duplicating an existing line.
